<event name="SMH_LIGHTSPEED_SECTOR_WARP_UNION_GENERIC">
	<text>Name: Union Controlled Sector
	Type: Friendly
	Unique: False
	Dominant Faction: Galactic Union
	Rebel Threat Level: Medium-Low
	
	The Galactic Union is widely mocked for its name - don't be fooled. It's far from galactic, though its leaders would like to make you think it is. The Union is an alliance of many various previously independent corporate states. While primarily populated by humans, the Union has become the sanctuary for many alien refugees during recent times.</text>
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Continue with the jump.</text>
		<event>
			<text>You prepare to jump to the new co-ordinates, and change your flight path accordingly.</text>
			<variable name="loc_sector_count" op="add" val="-1"/>
			<choice hidden="true">
				<text>Continue...</text>
				<event>
					<secretSector>SECTOR_UNION</secretSector>
				</event>
			</choice>
		</event>
	</choice>
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Nevermind.</text>
		<event>
			<loadEvent>ATLAS_MENU_NOEQUIPMENT</loadEvent>
		</event>
	</choice>
</event>
	
<event name="SMH_LIGHTSPEED_SECTOR_WARP_FEDERATION_GENERIC">
	<text>Name: Federation Controlled Sector
Type: Friendly
Unique: False
Dominant Faction: The United Federation
Rebel Threat Level: Medium (Neutral Fleet)

The Federation has rebounded greatly since the days of the Civil War, and its territory is more vibrant than ever. Of course, don't expect it to be absent of hostiles - the Rebellion continues to push hard to regain control of this reality!</text>
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Continue with the jump.</text>
		<event>
			<text>You prepare to jump to the new co-ordinates, and change your flight path accordingly.</text>
			<variable name="loc_sector_count" op="add" val="-1"/>
			<choice hidden="true">
				<text>Continue...</text>
				<event>
					<secretSector>SECTOR_FEDERATION</secretSector>
				</event>
			</choice>
		</event>
	</choice>
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Nevermind.</text>
		<event>
			<loadEvent>ATLAS_MENU_NOEQUIPMENT</loadEvent>
		</event>
	</choice>
</event>
	
<event name="SMH_LIGHTSPEED_SECTOR_WARP_ENGI_GENERIC">
	<text>Name: Engi Controlled Sector
	Type: Friendly
	Unique: False
	Dominant Faction: Engi Harmony
	Rebel Threat Level: Low
	Locations of Interest: Harmony Link

	The Engi are non-violent and generally friendly with the Federation. As long as you can avoid miscommunication errors, the native inhabitants will be little trouble. The same cannot be said, however, for other hostile invaders.</text>
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Continue with the jump.</text>
		<event>
			<text>You prepare to jump to the new co-ordinates, and change your flight path accordingly.</text>
			<variable name="loc_sector_count" op="add" val="-1"/>
			<choice hidden="true">
				<text>Continue...</text>
				<event>
					<secretSector>SECTOR_HARMONY</secretSector>
				</event>
			</choice>
		</event>
	</choice>
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Nevermind.</text>
		<event>
			<loadEvent>ATLAS_MENU_NOEQUIPMENT</loadEvent>
		</event>
	</choice>
</event>


<event name="SMH_LIGHTSPEED_SECTOR_WARP_ZOLTAN_GENERIC">
	<text>Name: Zoltan Controlled Sector
	Type: Friendly
	Unique: False
	Dominant Faction: Zoltan Ministry
	Rebel Threat Level: Medium-Low

	Tensions between the Federation and Zoltans are high, but the Zoltans ultimately favor law and order over just about anything else. Don't push any buttons, and hopefully the Zoltans will let you pass without issue.</text>
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Continue with the jump.</text>
		<event>
			<text>You prepare to jump to the new co-ordinates, and change your flight path accordingly.</text>
			<variable name="loc_sector_count" op="add" val="-1"/>
			<choice hidden="true">
				<text>Continue...</text>
				<event>
					<secretSector>SECTOR_MINISTRY</secretSector>
				</event>
			</choice>
		</event>
	</choice>
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Nevermind.</text>
		<event>
			<loadEvent>ATLAS_MENU_NOEQUIPMENT</loadEvent>
		</event>
	</choice>
</event>


<event name="SMH_LIGHTSPEED_SECTOR_WARP_ORCHID_GENERIC">
	<text>Name: Gathering Controlled Sector
	Type: Friendly
	Unique: False
	Dominant Faction: Orchid Gathering
	Rebel Threat Level: Low

	The Orchids are a peaceful race, lucky for you. Their specially grown kernel weaponry makes them powerful enemies, so be glad the plants will rarely attack you without you attacking first.</text>
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Continue with the jump.</text>
		<event>
			<text>You prepare to jump to the new co-ordinates, and change your flight path accordingly.</text>
			<variable name="loc_sector_count" op="add" val="-1"/>
			<choice hidden="true">
				<text>Continue...</text>
				<event>
					<secretSector>SECTOR_GATHERING</secretSector>
				</event>
			</choice>
		</event>
