<event name="SMH_LIGHTSPEED_SECTOR_WARP_OUTCAST_GENERIC">
	<text>Name: Outcast Controlled Sector
	Type: Friendly
	Unique: False
	Dominant Faction: Rock Outcasts
	Rebel Threat Level: Low

	These sectors were once filled with industry and held strongly by the Theocracy. However, in recent times as the Elders' grasp slowly slips from their empire, these lands have become the prime locations for the political dissidents and refugees exiled from their old homes. Apparently, agents sent by the Crystalline Empire working for the "Sister-Species Liberation Group" have taken residence among the outcasts as well.</text>
