	<text>Name: Duskbringer Controlled Sector
	Type: Hostile
	Unique: False
	Dominant Faction: Duskbringers
	Rebel Threat Level: High

	The Duskbringers are much more aggressive than the Zoltan Ministry, and their sectors are a testament to it. Even worse, the Duskbringers and Rebels used to work in junction, and only recently split as the local and interdimensional forces feud over whether to maintain their alliance. It's unlikely you'll see many friendly faces here.</text>
