	<text>Name: Shell Controlled Sector
	Type: Friendly (Nebula)
	Unique: False
	Dominant Faction: Shell Geniocracy
	Rebel Threat Level: Medium (Auto Fleet)

	The Shells are usually friendly, but their cultural practices often lead to misunderstandings with races when they attempt to run harmless experiments on abducted crew. Try to be tolerant, and the Shells won't be much of an issue to you.</text>
