	<text>Name: Leech Controlled Sector
	Type: Neutral (Hazard)
	Unique: False
	Dominant Faction: Eargen Republic
	Rebel Threat Level: Low

	Don't expect your largest threat here to be the Leeches themselves. Their kind have mostly stayed neutral towards the Federation - the risk lies between the Inquisition and Coalition forces allied with the Republic. Be careful with who you confide in here, and try not to take too much advantage of the downtrodden citizens here.</text>
