	Dominant Faction: None
	Rebel Threat Level: Medium

	This was once a civilian sector, but after heavy conflict it was abandoned. Now, it serves as a melting pot of scavengers from all over the galaxy hoping to make a profit off of not just the ruins, but ships like yours as well.
	At the bottom of your Atlas, you notice a small "H" logo... a sponsorship? It reads "Come visit the local Hektar Industries Market Places!" Huh...</text>
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Continue with the jump.</text>
		<event>
			<text>You prepare to jump to the new co-ordinates, and change your flight path accordingly.</text>
			<variable name="loc_sector_count" op="add" val="-1"/>
			<choice hidden="true">
				<text>Continue...</text>
				<event>
					<secretSector>SECTOR_ABANDONED_GENERIC_HEKTAR</secretSector>
				</event>
			</choice>
		</event>
	</choice>
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Nevermind.</text>
		<event>
			<loadEvent>ATLAS_MENU_NOEQUIPMENT</loadEvent>
		</event>
	</choice>
</event>

<event name="SMH_LIGHTSPEED_SECTOR_WARP_LEECH_SALE">
	<text>Name: Leech Controlled Sector
	Type: Neutral (Hazard)
	Unique: False
	Dominant Faction: Eargen Republic
	Rebel Threat Level: Low

	Don't expect your largest threat here to be the Leeches themselves. Their kind have mostly stayed neutral towards the Federation - the risk lies between the Inquisition and Coalition forces allied with the Republic. Be careful with who you confide in here, and try not to take too much advantage of the downtrodden citizens here.
	At the bottom of your Atlas, you notice a small "H" logo... a sponsorship? It reads "Come visit the local Hektar Industries Market Places!" Huh...</text>
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Continue with the jump.</text>
		<event>
			<text>You prepare to jump to the new co-ordinates, and change your flight path accordingly.</text>
			<variable name="loc_sector_count" op="add" val="-1"/>
			<choice hidden="true">
				<text>Continue...</text>
				<event>
					<secretSector>SECTOR_REPUBLIC_HEKTAR</secretSector>
				</event>
			</choice>
		</event>
	</choice>
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Nevermind.</text>
		<event>
			<loadEvent>ATLAS_MENU_NOEQUIPMENT</loadEvent>
		</event>
	</choice>
</event>
	
<event name="SMH_LIGHTSPEED_SECTOR_WARP_MINING_GENERIC">
	<text>Name: Mining Sector
	Type: Neutral (Hazard)
	Unique: False
	Dominant Faction: None
	Rebel Threat Level: Low
	
	Sectors like these are littered with mineral-rich asteroid belts that draw in all sorts of prospectors. Though competition for coveted resources is high, the only major threat to you are the asteroids themselves.</text>
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Continue with the jump.</text>
