<event name="SMH_LIGHTSPEED_SECTOR_WARP_AUGMENTED_SECRET">
	<text>Name: Ancient Recovery Site
	Type: Neutral
	Dominant Faction: Augmented Lanius
	Rebel Threat Level: Low

	There is little information on this sector. It seems the ruins of some ancient race have been uncovered here, and it was promptly swarmed by a band of Lanius known as the Augmented.</text>
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Continue with the jump.</text>
		<event>
			<text>You prepare to jump to the new co-ordinates, and change your flight path accordingly.</text>
			<choice hidden="true">
				<text>Continue...</text>
